In April, Brady worked 6 hours/day * 30 days = 180 hours
In June, Brady worked 5 hours/day * 30 days = 150 hours
In September, Brady worked 8 hours/day * 30 days = 240 hours

Total hours worked = 180 + 150 + 240 = 570 hours

There are 3 months, so the average is: 570 hours / 3 = 190 hours

